sequenceDiagram
    box rgb(232,245,245) Namespace: team-a
        participant A as Agent Pod<br/>(SA: team-a/ogx-dev)
    end

    box rgb(240,235,248) OGX Server
        participant OGX as OGX Server<br/>(ABAC Engine)
    end

    box rgb(240,240,240) Storage
        participant DB as PostgreSQL
    end

    box rgb(255,243,232) Namespace: team-b
        participant B as Agent Pod<br/>(SA: team-b/ogx-dev)
    end

    Note over A,B: Both teams share the same OGX instance and database

    A->>OGX: POST /v1/responses<br/>"Summarize quantum computing"
    Note over OGX: Stamp owner:<br/>principal = team-a/ogx-dev
    OGX->>DB: INSERT (owner = team-a)
    DB-->>OGX: OK
    OGX-->>A: response_id: resp_001

    B->>OGX: POST /v1/responses<br/>"Explain neural networks"
    Note over OGX: Stamp owner:<br/>principal = team-b/ogx-dev
    OGX->>DB: INSERT (owner = team-b)
    DB-->>OGX: OK
    OGX-->>B: response_id: resp_002

    rect rgb(245, 250, 245)
    Note over A,B: Each team lists their responses

    A->>OGX: GET /v1/responses
    Note over OGX: ABAC filter:<br/>WHERE owner = team-a
    OGX->>DB: SELECT WHERE owner = team-a
    DB-->>OGX: [resp_001]
    OGX-->>A: [resp_001] only

    B->>OGX: GET /v1/responses
    Note over OGX: ABAC filter:<br/>WHERE owner = team-b
    OGX->>DB: SELECT WHERE owner = team-b
    DB-->>OGX: [resp_002]
    OGX-->>B: [resp_002] only
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 245)
    Note over A,B: Cross-tenant access attempt

    A->>OGX: GET /v1/responses/resp_002
    Note over OGX: ABAC check:<br/>team-a ≠ owner(team-b)
    OGX-->>A: 403 Access Denied

    A->>OGX: DELETE /v1/responses/resp_002
    Note over OGX: ABAC check:<br/>team-a cannot delete<br/>team-b's resource
    OGX-->>A: 403 Access Denied
    end
